                "text": "Republicans' cuts to Medicaid would\u00a0force millions of American families to lose coverage & access to vital care.\n\nTheir efforts to cut Medicaid to fund tax cuts for the wealthy is cruel & catastrophic for the health of hard-working Americans & our nation.\n\nhttps://t.co/FXgKnOxSCQ",
